From 1099fe3b32a962d1cb4d7cb30e867df4f0450265 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yuya Inoue <65857152+inoway46@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 03:43:39 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] build: use a single producer for shared generated files

Cross builds instantiate several shared generation actions in both
toolsets, producing duplicate output rules that Ninja rejects.

Register these actions once in the target toolset and explicitly share
them with host consumers. Keep generator executables in the host toolset
for cross builds.

Refs: https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/66803
Assisted-by: Codex
Signed-off-by: inoway46 <inoueyuya416@gmail.com>
PR-URL: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/66804
Reviewed-By: Chengzhong Wu <legendecas@gmail.com>
